              "text": "খেজুর (khejur) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from kharjūra, \"the date-palm\" (CDIAL 3828). CDIAL lists Bengali khejur and khājur for the tree and its fruit."
